    "learn.faq.a2": "Sign in with your e-mail address: a code is enough, no password. For the free trial, then give your name, your organisation and your role.",
    "learn.faq.q3": "Can we pay on a quote or with a purchase order?",
    "learn.faq.a3": "Yes. Ask for a quote from the offer: the licence is opened on receipt of your order, for the agreed term.",
    "learn.faq.q4": "Can the AI change my network without me?",
    "learn.faq.a4": "No. The AI proposes, the engine measures each objective, and nothing is applied without your acceptance. Every version stays undoable.",
    "learn.faq.q5": "What happens to my GTFS?",
    "learn.faq.a5": "It is worked on in an isolated copy, kept for a limited time. You can export or delete your data at any time.",
    "learn.faq.q6": "Which formats for the brief?",
    "learn.faq.a6": "PDF, Word, Excel, OpenDocument and CSV, as they are. Timetable grids are read cell by cell, with nothing retyped.",
